{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22461","headline":"花下对酒二首 二 · 白居易","name":"花下对酒二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"引手攀红樱，红樱落似霰。\n仰首看白日，白日走如箭。\n年芳与时景，顷刻犹衰变。\n况是血肉身，安能长强健。\n人心苦迷执，慕贵忧贫贱。\n愁色常在眉，欢容不上面。\n况吾头半白，把镜非不见。\n何必花下杯，更待他人劝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22461.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22461","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}